    "It is signed by a certificate that does not chain to Apple, so nobody Apple checked stands behind it." : {
      "comment" : "Warning detail: the signing certificate does not chain to Apple (self-signed or another authority).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
